      <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Bangladesh's emerging fashion-tier credibility, led by facilities like SDF Clothing, demonstrates that premium production capability exists beyond traditional European and Japanese manufacturing centers. The geography of fashion-tier manufacturing is expanding, creating new options for brands seeking quality construction without European pricing. Designers who approach manufacturing with collaborative mindset rather than transactional expectations build partnerships that genuinely improve both design and production quality over time.</p>
      
